<title>PHILIPPINES: Urbancorp Realty says 1996 net up 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Urbancorp Realty says 1996 net up 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urbancorp Realty Developers Inc, the real estate arm of Urban Bank, said on Tuesday the company posted 134 million pesos in net income in 1996, a 33 percent increase from 1995's 101 million pesos.</p>
</text>
